e during Next Fest. That's just how it is. Good luck!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T19:31:51Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706692452","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3612300-1828894815554188","game_id":"steam-3612300","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest is live!","summary":"April Fools’ !But this is not a joke — you really can try the multiplayer from April 1 to April 7.Access opens at 12:00 GMT 0. Bring your friends and tell us what you think.A big request: after that, please leave feedback in the Google Form —Here. Or in any other way.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-01T09:40:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1828894815554188","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3612300-1826992588599214","game_id":"steam-3612300","kind":"update","title":"Update, info, blah blah blah","summary":"So, boys.Nobody probably cares, of course, but we’re still working — for the sake of that one single comment under the previous Steam news post from XXX-Defalt-XXX.I asked an AI to turn the task list that keeps piling up during development into something like patch notes.Anyway, soon — just a few small things left to finish, and I’ll slap out a playtest. Make card sounds.To doMake menu sounds.Redo the resurrect sound.Make the player gun sound.Make the hobo reload-top-up sound.Test it.Rework the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-03-15T08:56:58Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1826992588599214","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3612300-1799088287901137","game_id":"steam-3612300","kind":"announcement","title":"Where We're At with Development","summary":"Hi there!The work hasn't stopped. Over the past month, we've done a lot, though a surprising amount of time and energy went into the Steam page itself. (Making the trailer, gifs, and decent-looking screenshots is way harder than it sounds.) The big thing — lighting. I got feedback on the screenshots and trailer — many people didn’t like the lighting, so I redid it. You can already see the updated version in the re-recorded trailer. I’ll probably need to start a regular development log soon, but ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2025-05-10T15:44:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1799088287901137","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:35Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3612300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:15Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:14Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3612300":"2026-10-26T10:40:15Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3612300":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:14Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:14Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:14Z"},"4724160":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:15Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:15Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:40:15Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3612300","app_id":3612300,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"a763482c8ca4435d0f4be1b3e604798aa72e9ada687d90bd3e6a01e3c1f